{"engine":"stitch","flow":"Folio3 Parking is one responsive web app. Employees sign in with Google, register vehicles, manage dedicated-space releases and claim temporary availability. Parking Administrators manage employee parking records, settings, access/report recipients, and utilization. Keep employee and administrator navigation separate and consistent within each role. Use compact, orderly SaaS/workforce patterns: plain navigation, small readable type, hairline dividers, restrained surfaces, status lozenges, tight tables, and no oversized hero areas. Let the product design system determine all colours and fonts. Every page must work at phone, tablet, and desktop widths; use touch-sized controls on narrow screens.","header":{"createdAt":"2026-10-12T12:04:44.654Z","inputsHash":"","kind":"design","producedBy":{"model":"gpt-6-luna","stage":"design"},"runId":"20261012-folio3-parking-app-introductio-0790","schemaVersion":1},"mapping":{"orphanScreens":[],"unmappedReqs":[]},"noScreen":[{"reason":"The sign-in page starts Google OAuth and shows failure states, but validating the Google ID-token signature, issuer and audience, verifying OAuth state, and creating a session only after active-employee checks are server-side callback/security operations; the callback itself is not a separate user-facing page.","req":"REQ-1"},{"reason":"The initial administrator grant is deployment bootstrap behavior: setup stays incomplete until configuration identifies a designated active Folio3 account, then grants that account the first Parking Administrator role. The administrator pages cover settings and subsequent role configuration; no separate page is needed for the deployment-time grant.","req":"REQ-5"},{"reason":"The fixed-template email is an automated notification sent when a released allocation becomes claimable; email delivery is not a page in the web app.","req":"REQ-14"},{"reason":"Preserving the existing permanent-sticker process and any temporary claim when a stickered vehicle arrives is an integration/allocation rule, not a user-facing page.","req":"REQ-15"},{"reason":"Authenticating trusted LPR equipment, requiring a unique authenticated request ID or nonce, rejecting replayed IDs/nonces, checking the detected readable plate against that date’s temporary authorizations, and activating the indicator only for valid authorization are equipment-integration operations with no human page.","req":"REQ-16"},{"reason":"On every failed entrance verification, explicitly deactivating the green indicator and denying temporary-parking entry is a fail-safe integration command, not a user-facing page.","req":"REQ-17"},{"reason":"Entrance verification attempts must be persisted with timestamp, readable plate when available, result, and entry status. This is automatic audit recording; the requirement does not ask for a separate entrance-attempt page.","req":"REQ-18"},{"reason":"The background use-counting rule—count an allocation as used when any vehicle registered to its employee is detected that day—is automatic event processing. Its statistics and records are shown in the Utilization page.","req":"REQ-19"},{"reason":"The Monday-morning office-time-zone job that compiles weekly statistics and unused dedicated/temporary parking is scheduled report generation. The resulting report is shown in the Utilization page; the scheduler has no page of its own.","req":"REQ-20"},{"reason":"Filtering the named report-recipient list at delivery time so that employee-identifying report emails go only to configured recipients with the Parking Administrator role is backend mail-delivery enforcement. The configured list and eligibility are shown in Access & Reports.","req":"REQ-21"},{"reason":"The Utilization page serves authorized administrators. Enforcing denial of both utilization-list and CSV operations for every other role is an access-control rule, not a separate page.","req":"REQ-22"},{"reason":"Applying Folio3’s existing records-retention policy to parking-release audit history, LPR attempts, and utilization events is an automatic retention operation and has no page of its own.","req":"REQ-23"}],"screens":[{"facts":{"buttons":["Continue with Google"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":[],"title":"Parking for Folio3 employees","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/SignInPage.tsx","frames":["ST-1"],"id":"S-1","reqs":["REQ-1","REQ-6"],"route":"/sign-in","size":"new","states":["OAuth is loading: show a concise progress state while Google sign-in is underway.","Invalid OAuth state, invalid ID token, inactive/non-Folio3 account, or failed callback: show a clear sign-in error and do not create an authenticated session."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Release my space today"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["My Parking","Recent Activity","Employee Record","Maya Chen","Registered Vehicle"],"title":"My Parking","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/employee/MyParkingPage.tsx","frames":["ST-2"],"id":"S-2","reqs":["REQ-2","REQ-3","REQ-6","REQ-7","REQ-8"],"route":"/parking","size":"new","states":["No registered vehicle: show a blocking notice that release and claim operations require at least one registered plate, with the My Vehicles menu item visible.","Release submitted: show the same-day release recorded once and the claimable-at time; disable the release action for that date.","Parking already released or claimed: show its current status and prevent a second release.","Non-working day: show the employee’s assignment but indicate that the configured work calendar does not expect a dedicated-space release."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Claim space"],"columns":["Level / Floor","Release Time","Status","Vehicle Assigned","Action"],"fields":["Vehicle Designated for Claim"],"headings":["Immediate Bay Release Feed"],"title":"3 spaces available now","ui":[[2,"1 table"]]},"file":"src/pages/employee/AvailableSpacesPage.tsx","frames":["ST-3","ST-4"],"id":"S-3","reqs":["REQ-3","REQ-6","REQ-11","REQ-12","REQ-13"],"route":"/parking/available","size":"new","states":["No available releases: show an empty state with the current available-space count at zero.","No registered vehicle: block claiming and explain that a registered plate is required.","Claim confirmed: show the accepted claim, assigned floor and space, selected registered vehicle, and that the confirmed claim cannot be cancelled.","Claim lost a race to an earlier accepted claim: keep the page current and explain that the space was assigned to the earlier claim."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Schedule releases","Cancel release"],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Release Schedule","Release Governance & Policies","Active Releases & Recent Log"],"title":"Release Schedule","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/employee/ReleaseSchedulePage.tsx","frames":["ST-5","ST-6"],"id":"S-4","reqs":["REQ-6","REQ-9","REQ-10"],"route":"/parking/releases","size":"new","states":["No scheduled releases: show an empty schedule and the date limit.","Invalid date selection beyond 30 days or on a non-working date: explain validation and do not save it.","Schedule saved: show each selected date and its configured claimable time.","Cancellation succeeds only before claim: update the release status to Cancelled.","Cancellation attempted after claim: reject the action and preserve the claimed status."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Edit details","Add vehicle"],"columns":[],"fields":["Vehicle Make & Model","License Plate","Vehicle Description (Optional)"],"headings":["My Vehicles","Registered Vehicles","Register New Vehicle"],"title":"My Vehicles","ui":[[4,"form of 4 fields (multi-choice)"]]},"file":"src/pages/employee/MyVehiclesPage.tsx","frames":["ST-7","ST-8"],"id":"S-5","reqs":["REQ-2","REQ-3","REQ-6"],"route":"/parking/vehicles","size":"new","states":["No vehicles registered: show an empty registration form and explain that a plate is required before parking release or claim operations.","Invalid or duplicate plate: show inline validation beside the plate field without clearing other form values.","Vehicle saved: show a concise success status and the new registered-vehicle row."]},{"facts":{"buttons":[],"columns":[],"fields":[],"headings":["Parking overview","Operational Status","Today's Activity"],"title":"Parking overview","ui":[]},"file":"src/pages/admin/AdminOverviewPage.tsx","frames":["ST-9"],"id":"S-6","reqs":["REQ-5","REQ-6"],"route":"/admin","size":"new","states":["If bootstrap configuration has not established a designated active Folio3 administrator, do not expose administrator controls; show an access-restricted setup status instead."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Reassign Bay","Save Changes","Register Vehicle","Remove Vehicle","Edit Vehicle Record"],"columns":["Employee","Department","Status","Parking Assignment","Floor","Registered Vehicles"],"fields":["Parking Assignment","Facility Floor"],"headings":["Corporate Directory Details (Read-Only)","Parking Assignment & Floor Controls","Registered Commute Vehicles"],"title":"Workforce Directory & Parking Allocations","ui":[[3,"form of 2 fields (dropdown)"],[1,"search and filters"],[2,"1 table"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/EmployeesPage.tsx","frames":["ST-10","ST-11"],"id":"S-7","reqs":["REQ-2","REQ-4","REQ-6"],"route":"/admin/employees","size":"new","states":["No directory matches the filters: show an empty result state without implying that directory records can be edited.","Assignment or vehicle form has invalid values: show inline validation.","Assignment or vehicle change saved: show a confirmation and updated row.","Employee has no parking assignment or registered vehicle: provide same-page create controls."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Save settings"],"columns":["DECK / LEVEL","ALLOCATION","EDITABLE SPACES"],"fields":["Release Cutoff Time *"],"headings":["Parking settings","Daily release time","Work calendar","Floor capacity"],"title":"Parking settings","ui":[[3,"form of 1 field (field validation)"],[2,"1 table"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/ParkingSettingsPage.tsx","frames":["ST-12"],"id":"S-8","reqs":["REQ-5","REQ-6"],"route":"/admin/parking-settings","size":"new","states":["Invalid release time, floor capacity, or calendar values: show inline validation and retain the entered settings.","Settings saved: show the saved time, capacities, and calendar summary.","No working days configured: identify that no dedicated-space releases will be expected until a valid work calendar is saved."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Save access & recipients"],"columns":["Identity & Email","Assigned Role","Access Scope"],"fields":["Role for Leila Haddad","Role for Omar Siddiqui","Role for Priya Nair"],"headings":["Access & Reports","Administrator and Security Guard roles","Weekly report-recipient list"],"title":"Access & Reports","ui":[[3,"form of 2 fields (multi-choice)"],[2,"1 table"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/AccessReportsPage.tsx","frames":["ST-13"],"id":"S-9","reqs":["REQ-5","REQ-6","REQ-21"],"route":"/admin/access-reports","size":"new","states":["Invalid role assignment or recipient entry: show inline validation and do not apply the change.","Role or recipient list saved: show the updated role and delivery eligibility.","A named report recipient lacks the Parking Administrator role: visibly mark the address as excluded from employee-identifying report delivery."]},{"facts":{"buttons":["Previous","Next"],"columns":["Employee & Dept","Type","Allocated Date","Bay Assignment","Registered Vehicle","Sensor Telemetry","Audit Status"],"fields":[],"headings":["Utilization & Allocation Analytics","Daily Ledger Breakdown · Mon–Fri Cycle","Allocation Audit Trail"],"title":"Utilization & Allocation Analytics","ui":[[2,"1 table"]]},"file":"src/pages/admin/UtilizationPage.tsx","frames":["ST-14","ST-15","ST-16"],"id":"S-10","reqs":["REQ-6","REQ-19","REQ-20","REQ-22","REQ-24"],"route":"/admin/utilization","size":"new","states":["No utilization records match the current filters: show a clear empty result and keep filters available.","Report data is loading or unavailable: show a compact loading or error state without inventing totals.","A caller without the Parking Administrator role is denied access to utilization lists and CSV export."]}],"stitch":{"a11y":[{"rules":["label"],"screen":"S-9"}],"designMd":"72dd75d5466588961c30777f83f5b108fe6f160c8ce4d63c0201cffe44c0f07e","frames":{"ST-1":{"html":"e663402c249e0f09911c3024a6e0197c48db3e8dbb99df197272f3a00c13863e","image":"e6fb0352a35860f0b635797694a4f2f1e113b8043557cedced5e14a343ff5f92","name":"stitch-S-1-normal-e6fb0352.png","screen":"S-1","screenId":"a4dfb8f7ad0b4b15bc1ec3ffaf9cfc21","state":"normal"},"ST-10":{"html":"813996d5e982168b285ed4d8ffe45f371ad2078324b433982161db79199fbd67","image":"1bf49f4ab028dff0628a85c801e9c5d34d660cda6eecb69c2e4ed59e8778659a","name":"stitch-S-7-normal-1bf49f4a.png","screen":"S-7","screenId":"ecdcbc8a621f4f0ab9db7f8e64ebb35c","state":"normal"},"ST-11":{"html":"970965363d95c06e520759c1ea4c87e836eb1201b9832bb3851489738fdbfed3","image":"4b0be9eb1f9b0e8afb1170753d444d03804b54d05df5437319aef51e32a41ab7","name":"stitch-S-7-empty-4b0be9eb.png","screen":"S-7","screenId":"8d5d4a1fb8f24f86b36d8a11b52bfcd6","state":"empty"},"ST-12":{"html":"a17acc79d4a9f542f31e2bcda0d4d4b480e33f83acc54f7751a99210ba7118c7","image":"bd452278bbc86ec8c7b837fbd3c4d0b03dca79df97106157c791c3b05ace0cb0","name":"stitch-S-8-normal-bd452278.png","screen":"S-8","screenId":"ca7cde9433c845d991194f2a25d92c10","state":"normal"},"ST-13":{"html":"32142e559f8706e1f8be6bd51475207ed2988d4e22a54e8cef0b172341caccb1","image":"9124be6e93c577a0c544aac236a759f5331f9d3639c8690aa0c154ded503951a","name":"stitch-S-9-normal-9124be6e.png","screen":"S-9","screenId":"99befeec12da46c096c237c9530c47cc","state":"normal"},"ST-14":{"html":"556d79cc77069d3fa08beea39972c23c6b0ed74858e978d237d5d017212ccfb4","image":"c94d65b3a59979712c39acadc6f81a8433f75f7d85c35d1b660224a36075ca1b","name":"stitch-S-10-normal-c94d65b3.png","screen":"S-10","screenId":"f598bb44ce4d4e0ea4fd5f8a22f742a4","state":"normal"},"ST-15":{"html":"6b8076bea5e9c91c0d4eaa8ff541fb8a7ae171c6083b2d1783a0c146eaf9570